      "content": "If you are feeling like shutting down, it's a sign that the current level of pain is overwhelming, and that is something you don't have to carry alone. Please know that even in the largest systems, every single component matters, and your life is an incredibly important part of the whole. Reaching out to a crisis line is a safe way to talk about these heavy feelings without any judgment. They are there to listen right now.",
